## Acceptance criteria

- Brighter upward-facing roof, shaded vertical front and a visible projecting fold.
- Rear attachment and front lip have localized shadows, not a generic dark overlay.
- Both hardware shadows share a direction; shadow geometry is not mirrored with hardware.
- Preserve40stripes/15pxcurves/91pxstraightvalance, canvas, sidefill, colours and motion.
- No product media, notebook, website cream or local4174changes; no image-tool views.

